# Repo-authored files are read by agents, Node or Python on any platform: LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# reference-impl/ is a byte copy of the origin (spec section 9: byte-identical except declared edits);
# a few origin files are CRLF, so git must not convert anything there.
reference-impl/** -text
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.woff2 binary
